        "presenterNotes": "- As fleetd drives the tracker\n- Held overlays any status, set by anchor, convoy anchor, recall or the ruling cap\n- Held: off the frontier, no worker or sailor (a hand still spawns, the cap's sailor waits), arm refused, MR disarmed and drafted\n- Reap rolls a parent story or epic up to Done once all its children end, unless it is a standing convoy"
      },
      "name": "Ticket status (as fleetd drives the tracker)"
    },
